@startuml
title Realtime / event-driven синхронизация

database "Supabase Postgres" as Db
database "chats" as Chats
database "chat_messages" as Messages
participant "Supabase Realtime\npostgres_changes" as Realtime
participant "Chat list hook\nuseChatListRealtime" as ListHook
participant "Chat details hook\nuseChatDetailsRealtime" as DetailsHook
participant "support-admin UI" as UI
participant "DB trigger\ntr_message_deliver" as Trigger
participant "telegram-outcoming" as Outcoming
participant "Telegram Bot API" as Telegram

Db -> Chats: INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE из RPC/AI/workflow
Db -> Messages: INSERT/UPDATE из RPC/AI/delivery
Chats -> Realtime: WAL event
Messages -> Realtime: WAL event
Realtime -> ListHook: chats * events; chat_messages INSERT
Realtime -> DetailsHook: selected chat_messages INSERT/UPDATE; selected chat UPDATE
ListHook -> UI: patch inbox list или refresh page
DetailsHook -> UI: merge timeline/delivery state или refresh details

Messages -> Trigger: только manager pending message
Trigger -> Outcoming: pg_net HTTP POST
Outcoming -> Telegram: sendMessage
Outcoming -> Messages: delivery_status sent/failed

note bottom
  Realtime - слой синхронизации.
  Он не владеет workflow decisions, AI orchestration или delivery side effects.
end note

@enduml
